---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateButton from '../components/AffiliateButton.astro';

const title = 'How Stripchat Tokens Work (2026)';
const description = 'Learn how Stripchat tokens work, what tokens are used for, how free browsing differs from paid interaction, and what to check before buying tokens.';

const faq = [
  ['Do I need tokens just to browse Stripchat?', 'Public-room browsing can be available before you pay. Tokens become relevant when you choose optional paid interactions such as tipping or selected private features.'],
  ['What are Stripchat tokens used for?', 'Tokens are the platform currency used for optional paid interactions. The exact token cost of an interaction can depend on the model, feature, market and current offer shown on Stripchat.'],
  ['Is Stripchat a monthly subscription?', 'The core spending model is token-based rather than a single all-access monthly subscription. Some optional features or offers can differ, so check the current terms shown before paying.'],
  ['How much do Stripchat tokens cost?', 'Token-pack prices can vary by market, payment method, timing or promotion. StripUnion therefore explains the spending model and points visitors to the current live offer instead of publishing a price table that can become stale.']
];

const faqSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'FAQPage',
  mainEntity: faq.map(([question, answer]) => ({
    '@type': 'Question',
    name: question,
    acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: answer }
  }))
};
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} pageType="Article" extraSchemas={[faqSchema]}>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">
      <nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/stripchat">Stripchat Review</a><span>/</span><span>How Tokens Work</span></nav>
      <span class="kicker">Pricing intent · Updated September 2026</span>
      <h1>How Stripchat Tokens Work</h1>
      <p class="lead">Stripchat separates free public-room browsing from optional paid interaction. Tokens are the bridge between those two layers.</p>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_tokens_hero" label="See Current Token Options →" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section shell narrow">
    <div class="decision-grid">
      <div><span>Before tokens</span><strong>Browse public rooms</strong><p>Use the free layer to understand the platform before deciding whether to spend.</p></div>
      <div><span>With tokens</span><strong>Optional interaction</strong><p>Tipping and selected private or interactive features use the platform currency.</p></div>
      <div><span>Before buying</span><strong>Check the live offer</strong><p>Token packs and feature costs can vary, so treat the live checkout as the current source of truth.</p></div>
    </div>

    <section class="article-body">
      <section>
        <h2>1. Public browsing and token spending are different stages</h2>
        <p>You do not need to think about tokens the moment you land on Stripchat. Public rooms let you understand the navigation, room format and performers first. Tokens matter only when you choose to move from watching into a paid action.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Tokens are a platform currency, not a fixed membership fee</h2>
        <p>Instead of one price unlocking every interaction, Stripchat uses tokens as a flexible spending unit. That means the amount you spend depends more on what you choose to do than on how long you keep an account. If you prefer predictable recurring pricing, this distinction matters before you register or buy anything.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Different actions can use different numbers of tokens</h2>
        <p>A tip, a private interaction and other paid features should not be treated as one universal price. The relevant cost is the amount displayed for the specific action at the time you choose it. Check that number first, then decide whether the interaction is worth the token spend.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Token pack prices can change</h2>
        <p>Token-pack pricing can vary by market, payment method, timing or promotion. This is why StripUnion does not hard-code a large static price table. A table that was accurate when published can become misleading later. Use our <a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-pricing">Stripchat pricing guide</a> for the model, then check the current Stripchat offer for the live amount.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. A simple way to control spending</h2>
        <p>Decide the interaction you actually want before buying tokens. Then check the displayed token cost, buy only the amount you are comfortable using, and avoid treating repeated small purchases as invisible spending. If your goal is a private interaction, read the <a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-private-shows">private-show guide</a> first.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Use discovery tools before you spend</h2>
        <p>There is little reason to buy tokens before you know whether the rooms you want are easy to find. Browse the public experience first and, where available, use discovery features such as <a class="text-link" href="/stripchat-magic-search">Magic Search</a> to narrow the live rooms. Spending should come after discovery, not before it.</p>
      </section>
    </section>

    <section class="conversion-strip">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Check the live offer</span>
        <h2>Continue to AVCams after understanding the token model.</h2>
        <p>Use this guide to understand token mechanics, then continue to AVCams when you are ready to browse live rooms.</p>
      </div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_tokens_mid" label="Check Current Options →" />
    </section>

    <section class="related-guides">
      <span class="kicker">Continue your decision</span>
      <h2>Related StripUnion guides</h2>
      <div class="money-grid">
        <a class="money-card related-card" href="/stripchat-pricing"><h3>Stripchat Pricing</h3><span class="text-link">Understand the full spending model →</span></a>
        <a class="money-card related-card" href="/stripchat-private-shows"><h3>Private Shows</h3><span class="text-link">Understand paid interactions →</span></a>
        <a class="money-card related-card" href="/stripchat-magic-search"><h3>Magic Search</h3><span class="text-link">Improve room discovery →</span></a>
        <a class="money-card related-card" href="https://blog.stripunion.com/are-live-cam-sites-free/"><h3>Are Live Cam Sites Free?</h3><span class="text-link">Learn the free-vs-paid model →</span></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq">
      <span class="kicker">FAQ</span>
      <h2>Stripchat token questions</h2>
      {faq.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}</summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}
    </section>

    <section class="end-cta">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Ready to compare</span>
        <h2>Want to continue to the live experience?</h2>
        <p>Open AVCams after you understand the difference between free browsing and paid interaction.</p>
      </div>
      <AffiliateButton source="stripchat_tokens_bottom" label="Explore AVCams →" />
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
